    },
    "description": {
      "value": "This greasy stick emits a stomach-churning scent when held in hand.\n\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou cast acid arrow of the indicated level. A creature that takes initial acid damage from this spell become sickened 1. Use your spell DC if the creature attempts to recover from this sickness. This is an olfactory effect."
